fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"flv/GstEFlvMuxPad.html#GstEFlvMuxPad:flv-track-mode","fragment":"\n\tflv-track-mode\n\nDetermines whether to stream FLV in Enhanced multitrack or non-multitrack or legacy format\n\n\tFlags :\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRead\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWrite\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tDefault value :\tlegacy (2)\n\n"});